@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC20 Xem ban do va chi duong

actor "Khach tham quan" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebPublicUI - MapPage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPublicPoisController + PublicToursController + PublicPoiService + TourService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nPoiRepository + TourRepository + TourPoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo ban do
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau POI public
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI hop le
DataAccess -> Database: Doc du lieu POI
Database --> DataAccess: Tra POI
DataAccess --> Business: Tra danh sach
Business --> UI: Tra marker POI
opt URL co tour
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau chi tiet tour
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc tour va thu tu POI
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc Tour va TourPoi
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu
  DataAccess --> Business: Tra tour
  Business --> UI: Tra diem dung tour
end
UI -> UI: Hien thi marker va xin vi tri trinh duyet
Actor -> UI: Chon POI hoac bat dau chi duong
alt Co vi tri va cau hinh dich vu ngoai
  UI -> UI: Goi OpenRouteService truc tiep tu frontend
  UI -> UI: Nhan quang duong, thoi gian va ve tuyen
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi chi duong
else Tu choi vi tri, thieu cau hinh hoac loi mang
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi marker va thong bao khong tao duoc tuyen
end
note over UI
Phan chi duong khong di qua backend du an.
Khong co MapController hay MapService.
end note
@enduml
